<%- include('../partials/breadcrumb', { pageTitle: 'Privacy Policy' }) %>
<section class="py-24 px-5 lg:px-8 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-sm text-steel leading-relaxed" data-aos="fade-up">
    <p class="text-xs text-steel/70 mb-8">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-navy text-lg mb-2">1. Introduction</h3>
    <p class="mb-6"><%= site.companyName %> ("OWPL", "we", "us") respects the privacy of visitors to this website and is committed to protecting any personal information shared with us.</p>

    <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-navy text-lg mb-2">2. Information We Collect</h3>
    <p class="mb-6">We may collect information you voluntarily provide through our contact form, including your name, company, email address, phone number, and message content.</p>

    <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-navy text-lg mb-2">3. How We Use Information</h3>
    <p class="mb-6">Information submitted is used solely to respond to enquiries and provide requested information about our CFS, warehousing, and logistics services.</p>

    <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-navy text-lg mb-2">4. Data Security</h3>
    <p class="mb-6">We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information submitted through this website.</p>

    <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-navy text-lg mb-2">5. Third-Party Services</h3>
    <p class="mb-6">Our contact form uses EmailJS to deliver enquiries. Please refer to EmailJS's own privacy policy for details on their data handling.</p>

    <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-navy text-lg mb-2">6. Contact</h3>
    <p>For questions about this policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>" class="text-accent"><%= site.email %></a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
